  "findings": [
    "Native FIFO getter returns moves and remaining portion on first move; native run_fifo read path prorates move.value by valued quantity",
    "Native standard/AVCO company-dependent cost is not warehouse-specific acquisition cost",
    "product.value records manual product/lot/move value changes",
    "stock_landed_costs is an optional Community addon; recorded adjustments feed move valuation; no posted charges are added by PR13",
    "Lot valuation requires independent reconciled lot lineage; conservative incomplete status",
    "Native operational drilldown needs ordinary source ACLs"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No fabricated physical SO/quant/warehouse FIFO move association",
    "No automatic valuation method replay or update called"
  ]
}
